  "text": "KLDAS features a high-resolution (5 km) East Asia domain, observation-driven forcings, and an uncoupled architecture for flexibility. It performs long-term spin-up of the Noah Land Surface Model for physically consistent soil states and has real-time production capability. The system has demonstrated significant impacts on rainfall and meteorological fields in WRF case studies.",
